      "text": "API ROUTERS  (/api/v1/)\n──────────────────────────\n/auth          JWT login/logout\n/passkeys      WebAuthn FIDO2\n/items         CRUD + search + NLP\n/locations     areas + rack mgmt\n/barcodes      GS1 GTIN/QR/ZPL\n/scans         barcode scan apply\n/transactions  ledger read/export\n/dashboard     summary + charts\n/imports       CSV bulk upload\n/ai            copilot + forecast\n/users         admin user mgmt\n/chat          AI chat history\n/energy        InfluxDB realtime\n/energy_influx InfluxDB writes\n/rfid          WebSocket RP902\n/sandbox       seed + toggle",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
