      "locked": false,
      "text": "BACKGROUND TASKS  (lifespan)\n──────────────────────────────\nlow_stock_monitor_loop\n  polls stock_levels every 5 min\n  fires alerts when qty < reorder\n\nenergy_cleanup_loop\n  purges old InfluxDB readings\n\nAI embedding index build\n  BM25 + pgvector on startup\n  10k item embeddings cached\n\nMQTT subscriber client\n  HA1500W → InfluxDB pipeline\n  solar / load / AC / temp",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "BACKGROUND TASKS  (lifespan)\n──────────────────────────────\nlow_stock_monitor_loop\n  polls stock_levels every 5 min\n  fires alerts when qty < reorder\n\nenergy_cleanup_loop\n  purges old InfluxDB readings\n\nAI embedding index build\n  BM25 + pgvector on startup\n  10k item embeddings cached\n\nMQTT subscriber client\n  HA1500W → InfluxDB pipeline\n  solar / load / AC / temp",
