      "text": "SANDBOX SYSTEM\n──────────────────────────────\nX-Sandbox-Mode: true  header\nowns() sentinel logic:\n  None  → no filter (bg tasks)\n  0     → real data (normal)\n  >0    → sandbox (per-user)\nseed_user_sandbox()  on enable",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
